# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## The Wilderness Bound update had lots of small technical changes which added up - so please report any Bugs you catch on our Discord server. 
## We also moved away from crowdin for our translations and now have our own solution. Feel free to contribute: https://explorerseden.eu/translate/
## Thank you!

## Changes:
- Muddy Pig Variants can now also spawn in Dappled Forest Biomes
- Turkey Chicken Variant can now also spawn in Dappled Forrest Biomes
- Golden Chicken Variant can now also spawn in Abandoned Camp Structures
- Added Creeper Ruins Structure (Generates in Forest Biomes)
- Added Creeper Frog Variant (Frogs blown up by Creepers have a 33% chance to turn into this variant; can also spawn in Creeper Ruins Structures; Poops out Gunpowder when eating food entities)
- Creeper Cat Variant can now also spawn in Creeper Ruins Structures
- Added Zombified Pig Variant (Pigs have a 10% chance to turn into the Zombified Variant when 30 seconds or longer in the Nether)
- Added 18 progression advancements

## Fixes:
- Skeleton Pig variant having the wrong biome references for spawning